    "text": "I, Janaka Bandara Thennakoon, Minister of Lands and LandDevelopment, hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.",
